Any one buying such an harmonium of Messrs. Moore & Moore, pianoforte and harmonium makers, 104 and 105 Bishopsgate Street, London, for 165*s.* net, may have it tuned as an Harmonical, by my forks, and provided with an 'harmonical bar' as presently explained, both @@A@@
>>>
